### Eliminar aviso de mantenimiento — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/deleteNotice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noticeId": 1,
  "unitId": 1
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/deleteNotice
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noticeId": 1,
  "unitId": 1
}

### Validación: noticeId con tipo inválido → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/deleteNotice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noticeId": "no-numerico",
  "unitId": 1
}

### Aviso inexistente — verificar comportamiento del SP (200 o error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/deleteNotice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noticeId": 999999999,
  "unitId": 999999999
}
